  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When I close the VRChat application, it still shows up as \"running\" in the Steam display.\n\nI checked Task Manager and there is no sign of VRChat running. (EAC is still there?).\n\nWhen I quit SteamVR or quit the app from Steam, it still shows \"Stopping\" and I can't start VRChat again.\n\nI must restart your PC to start VRChat anew. (Log off did not work).\n\nThe problem is almost certain to occur after running it on SteamVR for an hour or so.  (I have not tried this on Desktop).\n\nPlease investigate this as it is a pain to restart the PC every time.\n\n---add message--\n\nThe EAC error codes are as follows\n\nI reinstalled VRChat and got the same error.\n\nErrorCode: 30005(CreateFile failed with 32.)",
